# Valley and Mountain Scene with Normals and Texture Coordinates
# Created by Gemini

# --- Geometric Vertices (v) ---
# Valley (y=0)
v -5.0 0.0 5.0
v 5.0 0.0 5.0
v 5.0 0.0 -2.0
v -5.0 0.0 -2.0
# Mountain (Base and Peak)
v -3.0 0.0 -3.0
v 3.0 0.0 -3.0
v 0.0 0.0 -8.0
v 0.0 5.0 -5.5

# --- Vertex Texture Coordinates (vt) ---
# Basic square mapping for the valley/mountain base
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vt 1.0 1.0
vt 0.0 1.0
# Peak coordinate
vt 0.5 0.5

# --- Vertex Normal Vectors (vn) ---
# Upward normal for flat valley
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
# Slanted normals for mountain faces (normalized to unit length)
vn -0.848048 0.529999 0.0
vn 0.848048 0.529999 0.0
vn 0.0 0.529999 -0.848048
vn 0.0 0.529999 0.848048

# --- Faces (f) using Geometric, Texture, and Normal Indices ---
# Format: f vertex_index/texture_index/normal_index

# Valley floor (Geometric 1-4, Texture 1-4, Normal 1)
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1 4/4/1

# Mountain sides (referencing indices defined above)
f 5/1/2 6/2/2 8/5/2
f 6/2/3 7/3/3 8/5/3
f 7/3/4 5/1/4 8/5/4
f 5/1/5 7/3/5 6/2/5